{"id":"626765","name":"面条菜鸡蛋煎饼","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/626765/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面条菜","amount":"一把"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"一个"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"少许"}],"sub":[{"name":"纯净水","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面条菜。","img":"images/626765/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"采摘的面条菜。","img":"images/626765/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"择好。","img":"images/626765/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"洗净，控水。","img":"images/626765/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"淖一下，捞出，过凉水，挤出多余水分。","img":"images/626765/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"切碎。","img":"images/626765/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"盆中放入面条菜、鸡蛋、少许面粉、五香粉和盐。","img":"images/626765/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加少许水，顺时针搅拌均匀成稀糊状。","img":"images/626765/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"平底锅烧热放少许油，倒入面糊。","img":"images/626765/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"摊匀。","img":"images/626765/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"小火慢煎。","img":"images/626765/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"翻面，煎至两面金黄色即可。","img":"images/626765/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/626765/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"切片。","img":"images/626765/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/626765/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"香酥可口。","img":"images/626765/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}